      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "Lulie is great to learn from for the \"inner game\". If you get trapped in your head often, she has great ideas on untangling yourself and using reason to question coercion within yourself and others. Her psychology * Deutschian epistemology combo is cool :)\nhttps://t.co/7wFCATOzHK",
