      "full_text" : "53/100\n\nin The Network State book, religious colonies outlasted for-profit ones.\n\nreligion offered worldview (what) and lifestyle (how).\n\nscience took over the \"what\" but left \"how\" unsolved.\n\ncan The Beginning of Infinity reunite both and be the post-religious solution we need? https://t.co/1gpOUX7to4",
